WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
LocalMind 0.8.0 | A local workspace, with room to think

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Write a prompt. Stream a response from a model on your computer.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Follow up in the same chat. Review drafts: small models can miss instructions.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Context tools and response presets stay close to the conversation.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Mini chat | Keep the conversation nearby. Pin it above other windows.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Start a draft in mini chat, then expand when you need more room.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:47.000
The full workspace keeps your conversation and unsent draft.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Choose a calm light or dark workspace.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Media studio | Images are experimental. Runway needs your key and approval.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:09.000
Your next question starts here. Download LocalMind from GitHub Releases.
